              You must train with intense, progressive resistance training 3 to 5 days per week. Prioritize multi-joint compound movements (barbell squats, deadlifts, bench presses, overhead presses, barbell rows, and weighted pull-ups). You must train within <strong>1 to 3 repetitions of muscular failure (RPE 7–9)</strong> and progressively add weight or repetitions over time.
            </p>
